<title>FRANCE: Rouen Oct 1-9 grain exports 195,526 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Oct 1-9 grain exports 195,526 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 195,526 tonnes between October 1 and October 9, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 547,000 tonnes in the whole of October 1995.</p>
<p>The 195,526 tonnes grain total included 155,382 tonnes of wheat and 40,144 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa				 15,600</p>
<p>    Cuba					  26,250</p>
<p>    Britain					3,170</p>
<p>    Italy					 41,394</p>
<p>    Morocco				     15,750</p>
<p>    Algeria				     25,612</p>
<p>    Greece					11,606</p>
<p>    Tunisia				     16,000</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia				33,000</p>
<p>    Colombia				     7,144</p>
<p>Officials said the port also shipped 7,000 tonnes of flour to West Africa in the same week.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
